Package: synthframe
Type: Package
Title: Extend Population Stratification Frames with Survey Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Roberto", "Cerina", email = "51832016+robertocerinaprojects@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Danielius", "Jonaitis", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits sequential multilevel logistic models to categorical survey
    outcomes, extends population stratification frames with estimated counts,
    and calibrates those counts to known margins. Supports posterior draws,
    multiple outcomes, geographic batches, and calibration diagnostics.
